s.</p></article><article class="status-card"><h3>Runtime load</h3><strong><?=htmlspecialchars((string)($metrics['memory_percent'] ?? '—'))?>%</strong><p>Memory usage reported by the bot host.</p></article></section></main></div></body></html>
